    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Melanie Lalonde",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100003987182915624202/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJZBPiOpbtfbN_8o9tHAq1qXox94TbPD3pTaLtTMQ_ePJJiyQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I absolutely love and respect Jas! She has been a godsend to me,  and came into my life at a time where I needed more than just hands to remove the hurt. Through her passion and dedication,  Jas helps her clients find the relief they need by providing tips and tricks that go beyond just massage therapy.  I am very blessed to have access to such a beautiful healing soul,  and I highly recommend her to anyone looking to have a complete mind body and soul healing experience.",
        "time": 1743952794,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jaclyn Cloutier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109607479755107815855/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIUyt_qu_iEbYSnfvSfwXa2b1eq-ymR_x8CA3Kb_7KrlxMPVA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve been seeing Jas for about two months, weekly appointments of Reiki and massage. She is so calming and amazing, she takes the time to talk through how you’re feeling, has so much knowledge to share and she truly has magic hands! Very professional and clean place. I always leave there feeling like a new woman. Couldn’t be happier, she’s the real deal!",
        "time": 1748741879,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lizane Tan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115542926366662280623/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVH6u9X_m2LAGbZayGY7Qeo1UhJcCAHB4GRQLgx2-1DQj_I8Ru-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Jas is such a lovely human, so full of light! She is attentive, responsive and genuinely caring to the needs of her clients. I found her when I was looking for a prenatal massage and she does a wonderful job every time.",
        "time": 1738201803,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tracey Goodleaf",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108554863211104933454/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0cycV0-bPdoj20JBDdFGyFfFqpI6YMVHs_9MWcN5R-dVV_CZagQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Jas Sethi is an excellent massage therapist.  Whether it be for relaxation or for aches and pains,\nshe gets results. She is a professional and knows her trade.  I cannot recommend her highly enough!",
        "time": 1738242340,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mandy Hopkins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109696221421630257750/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUbqtwM7PyyPNCA9pjVg-J4GJ8wSsBVsgnVcz6-7b0uVARIL6ta=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I HIGHLY recommend Jas! I am so grateful to my friend who recommended her! Her massage techniques are fantastic, she is very knowledgeable and she is also so kind, warm and caring. You genuinely feel like she wants the best for your wellbeing which has a wonderful positive affect on you. I would see her every week if I could!",
        "time": 1709646409,
        "translated": false
      }
